{
 "id": "story-saulus-omvendelse-hiphop",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-saulus-omvendelse-hiphop",
 "offset_seconds": -0.5600000000002439,
 "words_heard": 212,
 "words": 217,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I was breathing out threats against the church of the Way",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Letters from the high priest, chains for those who pray",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the road to Damascus, noon, the sun overhead",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A light from heaven flashed and I fell like the dead",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saul, Saul, why are you persecuting me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who are you, Lord, tell me who I'm meant to see",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am Jesus, the one you have been fighting",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Get up, go to the city, you'll be told what is right",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the road to Damascus I was blind",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I saw the light for the first time",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Scales fell from my eyes",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now I walk the road of life",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three days I sat in the dark, no food, no drink",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Couldn't see a thing, all I could do was think",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Ananias came and laid his hands on me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Brother Saul, the Lord has sent me so you can see",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Something like scales fell off and I rose",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Baptized in the name I had fought, now I know",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one I persecuted is the one who called my name",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief of sinners, saved by grace, never the same",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the road to Damascus I was blind",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
